-// FUNCTION: 8-point FFT
-// FILES: FFT8.v - 1-st stage, contains
-//        MPU707.v - multiplier to the factor 0.707.
-// PROPERTIES:1) Fully pipelined
-//		  2) Each clock cycle complex datum is entered
-//               and complex result is outputted
